[{"client_msg_id":"7abe67cd-5a24-4917-9684-f1b1477690df","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"isfname が違うなら分かるけど isk が違うのは長年 vim を使ってきていてもいまだに納得がいかない。","ts":"1620275359.386300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uYsZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"23ca7db1-453b-4529-987d-062394486bc5","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"VSCode の marketplace で見つけたのですが VSCode の拡張だけではなく language server (`jsref --stdio`) 自体や coc.nvim の拡張(おそらく最近追加)も作ってるマルチな方のやつを見つけました。コードアクションでちょっとリファクタ系。vim-lspでも動きました。 \u003chttps://github.com/slonoed/jsref\u003e","ts":"1620274517.385600","attachments":[{"fallback":"GitHub: slonoed/jsref","id":1,"title":"slonoed/jsref","title_link":"https://github.com/slonoed/jsref","text":"JavaScript refactoring language server. Contribute to slonoed/jsref development by creating an account on GitHub.","image_url":"https://opengraph.githubassets.com/a06951830cdaf101809cee4963b9cdfb966bc2fc2253aa4c8eb1d5091b1be3d9/slonoed/jsref","blocks":null,"service_name":"GitHub","service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/github.png","from_url":"https://github.com/slonoed/jsref","original_url":"https://github.com/slonoed/jsref"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":1,"users":["UD1FQV38V"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SFw5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8a88dbda-f77d-40c3-bf2a-81dd703bacf9","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"おそらく暗黙のうちに「単語要素にコロンを含めたいときは、iskeyword オプションに : という文字が入る」ことを仮定しているのではないでしょうか。ASCIIコードの数字などではなく、文字列を明示的に入れると。","ts":"1620270795.385400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"986"}]},{"client_msg_id":"474844f6-94c8-4d56-94de-1f63255f57b3","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"iskeyword って Windows とそれ以外でデフォの値、違うんですね。知らなかった","ts":"1620270391.385300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hee","count":1,"users":["UL6CFN8NR"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JmT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"deeaa583-c5df-4f5f-9852-6836bb1ac99f","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"一応。 vim-language-server の作者さんの coc.nvim extension の `coc-vimlsp` では 普通に `iskeyword` を渡していました。特に coc 側で `:` を追加してってのはないですが、補完の際はおそらく deoplete 等と同様によしなにやってくれてると思います。","ts":"1620269972.385100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Q3Kzk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"134598ce-08e6-441a-b9cd-c1261b3bc696","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"軽く grep かけてみた感じ、今のところこの `iskeyword` オプションが vim-language-server 内で実際に用いられているのは前に貼った completion のロジック部分だけっぽいので、最悪 `\":\"` 1文字の文字列とかを設定するのでも動きそうな気はします。\nもちろん、今後の実装で変わる可能性は十分にありますが。","ts":"1620269725.384800","edited":{"user":"UL6CFN8NR","ts":"1620269760.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FVFKL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9ac74f52-cefa-4c30-9e44-f6bd11ae5d98","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"自分もなったので、vim-lsp + vim-vsnip+integ でもだめかも","ts":"1620267704.383400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"z/My/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fad273bc-6e71-433c-a6ce-fdaceb9c934a","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"もしかしてこの vim-language-server の `:` の問題。 vim-vsnip + vim-vsnip-integ を入れてるとよしなに重複しないようになってたりするかも。vim-vsnip-integかな。僕の環境だけですかね","ts":"1620267403.382600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PGFOo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"16064d61-b367-4896-8586-80e2bd52264c","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"素でキックはされそうなので、やるなら固定値かグローバル引くか","ts":"1620267147.382300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ldpO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ac8546db-20c9-4c81-8f13-40ab21ec6c72","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"ただまあ isk と syntax は割と密結合なところもあるので難しいのもわかる","ts":"1620265418.381100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"mitzdo","count":2,"users":["U03C4RC8X","U8CC7MDCL"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rTr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4306d580-717d-4674-9010-a724f3ff2bc1","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"syntax でやるのはやめてほしい感","ts":"1620265374.380600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"705S"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4c83edeb-5276-4f20-9a09-591caac5adf5","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"例: \u003chttps://github.com/vim/vim/blob/b7c978154e0816f4dcfae8a06b4ba1bfb7f796f6/runtime/syntax/xquery.vim#L19\u003e","ts":"1620265351.380200","attachments":[{"fallback":"GitHub: vim/vim","id":1,"title":"vim/vim","title_link":"https://github.com/vim/vim/blob/b7c978154e0816f4dcfae8a06b4ba1bfb7f796f6/runtime/syntax/xquery.vim#L19","text":"The official Vim repository. Contribute to vim/vim development by creating an account on GitHub.","image_url":"https://opengraph.githubassets.com/00f98b3bd3ab860dcd9405f46d3ef54a6a291d7070fcd19f8d4690a01113674b/vim/vim","blocks":null,"service_name":"GitHub","service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/github.png","from_url":"https://github.com/vim/vim/blob/b7c978154e0816f4dcfae8a06b4ba1bfb7f796f6/runtime/syntax/xquery.vim#L19","original_url":"https://github.com/vim/vim/blob/b7c978154e0816f4dcfae8a06b4ba1bfb7f796f6/runtime/syntax/xquery.vim#L19"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kbYDk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"faa87cd3-5e3f-495e-b5c7-bdf8e6224b16","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"syntax の中には isk を弄ってファイルタイプ独自に変更してるやつとかいるんですよね。","ts":"1620265284.380000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"//v"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8043899a-f1c8-429f-921a-d2d92fc541f4","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"実際に試してみないとな (ブランチを試すの地味に面倒)","ts":"1620265273.379700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Pi45e"}]},{"client_msg_id":"67480db3-0232-425f-ac20-c3aa4c1a609d","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"thinca さんから ok 出たらマージします。","ts":"1620265245.379200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Fii3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"59fda457-2e39-4c48-88dc-4e8a0471de27","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"例えば lisp を編集していたら `-` が入っちゃったりするわけですよね。せめてグローバルの値を引く(`\u0026amp;g:isk` ) とかの方が安全かなと思いました","ts":"1620265194.378800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WuGGR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7695254c-eb08-4143-9360-1b617ebe30e1","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"なくはないですね、ユーザーの基本に合せたかったのでオプションから引きましたが、固定値もったほうがいいかな","ts":"1620265116.377800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QkqVM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d083bddd-b4ac-47c4-95e3-7c41dc7b727a","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"オプション名が省略形だったりケツカンマがなかったりするのが気になるけどこのリポジトリの標準スタイルを知らないのでそこはいいか","ts":"1620265092.377300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YpFs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9802483e-f0ff-4fac-ac18-2dddd4057741","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"\u003c@UAZ33BKV2\u003e 今さら vim-lsp-settings への PR 見たんですけど、この `\u0026amp;isk` が参照されるタイミングってどのバッファが開かれている時かわからないですよね。余計な文字が入っちゃう可能性ないですか?","ts":"1620265062.376600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XQc"}]}]
